   "kind": "say",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "「…………えっ、あっ？」",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11631,
   "key": "D0756.txt:30",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 30,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "俺の名を呼ぶ声に、目を覚ます。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11632,
   "key": "D0756.txt:32",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 32,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "まぶたを開けるのが億劫だった。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11633,
   "key": "D0756.txt:33",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 33,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "目の焦点がなかなか合わない。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11634,
   "key": "D0756.txt:35",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 35,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "ぼんやりとした視界、だが誰かが俺の顔を覗き込んでいることだけは分かる。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11635,
   "key": "D0756.txt:41",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 41,
   "speaker": "アル",
   "kind": "say",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "「ええい、だらしない！ しっかりせよ！」",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11636,
   "key": "D0756.txt:47",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 47,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "この乱暴な言葉使い。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11637,
   "key": "D0756.txt:48",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 48,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "間違いない。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11638,
   "key": "D0756.txt:50",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 50,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "俺は何度も目を瞬かせて、焦点を取り戻す。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11639,
   "key": "D0756.txt:55",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 55,
   "speaker": "九郎",
   "kind": "say",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "「……アル？」",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
