   "key": "D0756.txt:104",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 104,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "俺は異世界に連れて行かれて、そこで人間化したクトゥグアとイタクァに出遭ったんだ。",
   "ko_candidate": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11648,
   "key": "D0756.txt:107",
   "file": "D0756.txt",
   "line": 107,
   "speaker": null,
   "kind": "narr",
   "status": "MISSING",
   "work": true,
   "jp": "それにあの不思議な光景――",
